# The actor model checker (README.md), a std/go worker. It explores every order
# in which clients' messages can reach an actor, each transition being the inner
# request std/actor itself would run, and checks an invariant in every state.
# step.sh is the per-transition mapper, on std/bash.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go --bash:@=DEEP-DEPS/bash --step:@=step.sh
